      "end": 563,
      "start": 0,
      "text": "Chip (snack type)\nA chip ( American English and Australian English ) or crisp ( British English ) is any type of snack food in the form of a crisp , flat or slightly bowl shaped , bite-sized unit . Popular kinds of chip include : Bean chips Corn chips Pita chips Potato chips Tortilla chips Vegetable chips Chips are typically grain-based , but can be made of any food substance that can palatably be reduced to a thin , crisp form . Less conventional types include : Banana chips Carrot chips Kale chips Chips are often served in a combination of chips and dip ."
     }
